window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b>He is dangerous, mysterious, powerful. And he feeds on her desire.</b><br><br>Hansella’s life is painfully ordinary—long shifts at a dead-end café, lonely walks home, and a name she can’t stand. But everything changes one evening when she stumbles upon an unconscious man in a shadowy alley. What starts as an act of compassion turns into a nightmare as a monstrous demon emerges from the darkness, hungry for blood. <br><br>The stranger, Desmond, is no ordinary man. With Hansella’s kiss—he unleashes a power that defeats the creature but reveals his true nature: wings, horns, and a fiery aura that chills Hansella to her core. <br><br>Desmond warns her that her involvement has marked her as a target for other demons. Now, he offers an alliance: protection and training in exchange for her powerful desire—and her partnership in a growing war against the dark forces invading the city. <br><br>Torn between fear and gratitude, Hansella must decide: cling to her old life or step into a dangerous new one, where every choice could mean life or death. As the line between ally and monster blurs, Hansella realizes the monsters outside aren’t the only ones she has to fight. <br><br>Can she trust Desmond? Or will this alliance cost her everything?<br><br>This is Part 1 of \"Bound by his Desire\" an erotic dark fantasy romance<br><br><b>*Contains mature themes and content not suitable for all audiences. Reader discretion is advised.*</b>"; 
